            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A compound for use in a method of treating and/or preventing actinic keratosis in a subject in need thereof, the method comprising topically administering the compound to an affected area of the subject once a day at a dose of from 0.5 mg to 4 mg, wherein the affected area is 0.1 cm&amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;2&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt; to 100 cm&amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;2&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt;, and wherein the compound is KX-01:</p>
